{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6110f79399bc88732fee73fe7b104512b088fb4860abeeecdc36c59923185b12", "ja": "待望の撮影！", "zh": "期盼已久的拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b05f0fec6578293631381d930a9c5197fca6ef55cca00e8bfdec596f276641c4", "ja": "映画『誰ソ彼ノ淵』のロケ地に向かうアイド\nル達。遠くの島へと向かう船上で、泊りがけ\nの仕事に胸を弾ませる。主演の茜は特に気合\nいが入っている様子。浮かれるアイドル達を\n見て、気を引き締めるプロデューサー。", "zh": "前往电影《誰ソ彼ノ淵》拍摄地的偶像\n们。在驶向远方岛屿的船上，她们为这次\n过夜的工作而兴奋不已。主演茜尤其干劲\n十足。制作人看到兴奋过头的偶像们，也打起精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02fa29bb3dec024740e1784c672d0b651c1834e11019f5c2316fc0b6b4523b04", "ja": "（映画『誰ソ彼ノ淵』は、孤島が舞台。本物の\n孤島とまではいかないものの、撮影の舞台は島だ）", "zh": "（电影《谁黄昏之渊》的舞台设在孤岛上。虽说不上是真正的孤岛，但拍摄地点确实是一座岛）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "850dfdeacd9ddaafa2e6cc2a5ba03f19aca95718cedf71b9892d8849f520fc30", "ja": "青い海！　どこまでも続く空！\n森が……島が……茜ちゃんを呼んでいる！！", "zh": "蔚蓝的大海！一望无际的天空！森林……小岛……正在呼唤小茜！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "01d9a812e59050c08ecfafde15a0fd636644e59bcf76461e5d842b9a1be91e8f", "ja": "よかったネ、アカネ！　前にドラマの撮影をした時は、\nアカネだけ島に来られなくて、残念がってたもんネ。", "zh": "太好了呢，茜！之前拍电视剧的时候，只有茜没能来岛上，一直觉得很遗憾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "98025a18ffbb79e0d4b7e0f7994acd3dde4532c01e921be60e2a4d3e4cc6454a", "ja": "そう！　白く泡立つ波間に浮かぶ孤島の佇まい……。\n茜ちゃんはずっと、島に来たかったのです！", "zh": "没错！那座孤岛伫立在泛起白色泡沫的浪花之间……小茜一直都想来岛上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "f8c88e6c177e724e10821c92bb9bc14f6b0bf67ba7d0559b1bc7eda0d1d25f9a", "ja": "しほりん！　しほりんもロケ楽しみだったでしょ？\nもっと喜びを、全身で表現してもいいんだよ！", "zh": "小志保！你也很期待外景拍摄的吧？再用全身尽情表达你的喜悦也可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "9be619fec102fa9df88f4fad7f184f158cc43db6fe3b8d4eeeeb0887799f352c", "ja": "いえ、そこまでは……仕事ですし。\nエレナさんも、そうですよね？", "zh": "不，倒也不至于……毕竟是工作。\n艾莲娜也是这么想的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "b6ad5a4ffa91c3de50a895dd4199d7f49033eaaf82a624dafb6a3f79101865e6", "ja": "シホはクールだからネ！　ワタシは……アカネほどじゃ\nないケド、ちょっとだけテンション上がってるヨ♪", "zh": "志保很酷嘛！我呢……虽然比不上茜，但情绪也稍微高涨了一点哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "a5ee7b0bf28ca679ab0c6c891df12499ae7689bf765b2df23f2c73e487d50eab", "ja": "スタジオで撮影もいいけど、ロケは楽しいもんネ。\nせっかく、海に来たんだし。", "zh": "在摄影棚拍摄也不错，不过外景拍摄很有意思嘛。\n难得都来到海边了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "240c9b3cf4cc194fd212ba05a2d64cf22e850520b3de5149136e3387160f21f9", "ja": "まぁ……ちゃんと仕事をしていれば、\n休憩中に遊ぶくらい、いいんじゃないですか。", "zh": "不过……只要好好完成工作，休息时玩一会儿，应该也没什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "af2b9ba5110bb2464a7d506bcad396e9d30c51fe13ea63f209f956579ad84b2e", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！\nまだ移動中なのに、ずいぶん盛り上がってるな？", "zh": "大家，辛苦了！\n明明还在路上，就这么热闹啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "ddba1a20f06a6b4b8d917dfe3ffed06446cae7e241ad8cbf85453602760685d9", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃん！　盛り上がるのも\n仕方ないよね！　だって、リゾートだよ、リゾート！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！这么兴奋也是没办法的嘛！毕竟可是度假胜地呀，度假胜地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "ac74dc4e2a37202f954f53412297d6d1c2936900c20a5f2a17f8f0186d591975", "ja": "麦わら帽子に白ワンピースの清楚な茜ちゃんが\n浜辺にいたら、すっごく絵になると思うんだよね……。", "zh": "要是海边有一位戴着草帽、穿着白色连衣裙的清纯小茜，我觉得一定会美得像一幅画……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "30e6fb45e279bcb9dae0cc3c34b72de7dd5de97f09465656c48da625d4db552a", "ja": "そんな絵を撮る予定はないけど……\nとにかく、大きな仕事なんだ。しっかりやろうな！", "zh": "虽然没打算拍那样的画面……\n总之，这是项大工作。好好干吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "46b32158b1c40a47fb2a6852e3437f9efe024bd4f934f72c78bbb53c338a3082", "ja": "は～いっ♪", "zh": "好～的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "4161d930e824ad72ad784a2d87b8199c956275d53b3292a820a70fdd64bc32c2", "ja": "ハーイ♪", "zh": "嗨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "d85bb768c005c7cff978751791eff04bd28dde74a8e3ebefc63cf7c78bb0e54e", "ja": "んーーっ……。\nやっぱり船の旅って気持ちいいわ～。", "zh": "嗯——……果然还是乘船旅行最舒服了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "7602e115f0377fc2d99a4db60c67bf1b64b8d074a8181927fae6c1b11ddf0231", "ja": "電車って、なんだか苦手なのよね。みんな、\nあんな狭いところに詰め込まれて平気なのかしら？", "zh": "我总觉得不太擅长坐电车呢。大家被塞在那么狭小的地方，居然都不觉得难受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "19063269bf91ca7537155403b9eeed441cd9b975dd585d1e777cd481f1f40151", "ja": "ふふっ。伊織ちゃんの気持ち、すこしわかるわ。\n私も、混雑した電車はすこし苦手だから……。", "zh": "呵呵，我有点明白伊织的感受了。\n我也有点不太擅长应付拥挤的电车……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "ea8bc06ad4edb8090b38cbdd06072b72d831f2d37f143cf6dd4f0732b66210b2", "ja": "あー、事務所やお仕事にもクルーザーで通いたいわー。\n千鶴は船だと、どの辺りに行くことが多いの？", "zh": "啊～真想坐游艇去剧场和工作现场啊～\n千鹤乘船的话，平时一般都去哪一带？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "c7d4f2c905326de34bef022b163d3fcfc7bd573171c4b3748104389b0298f011", "ja": "ふ、船！？　わたくしは、持っておりませんが……\n知人の船に乗せていただくことはありましてよ！？", "zh": "船、船！？我、我可没有船……不过偶尔也会乘坐熟人的船哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "ea5d1a37cba1772fa425eed3ba6a6f36533d59d389a7fc80583d8a9707387830", "ja": "行く場所は、そうですわね……\nマリーナから定置網までの定期クルージングですわ！", "zh": "要去的地方嘛……就这样吧，从游艇码头到定置网的定期游船之旅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "b298b432f4ede06d66dada58fbe3f9f9a98b9c5a4259d6c1bc14fb946116426d", "ja": "てぃーちあみー……。\nわかったわ、沖縄ね！　南の島、いいじゃない♪", "zh": "“蒂奇阿米”……我明白了，是冲绳吧！南方小岛，真不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "712d9fe88d7d25239be47bd39736c73a633548c3914673e627801cec14c4e6e6", "ja": "素敵！　綺麗なお魚がたくさんいそうね。\n千鶴ちゃんや伊織ちゃんのお話、もっと聞きたいわ！", "zh": "太棒了！感觉一定会有很多漂亮的鱼。\n我还想多听听千鹤和伊织的故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "02e215596c429405360815a0913509a769477fadfe854cb382b2bda826d194e9", "ja": "今回みたいに、泊りがけのお仕事なんて、\nあまりないでしょ？　だから私、とっても楽しみなの！", "zh": "像这次这样需要住一晚的工作，不太常有吧？所以我特别期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "ed67f79c534475570590fe41f903debf3e250a3c4d07a499c468aaa4f80d0f55", "ja": "え、ええ。わたくしでよければ、お話しいたしますわ！\nオーッホッホッホッ、げほっ、ごほっ。……はぁ。", "zh": "呃、嗯嗯。如果您不嫌弃的话，就由我来为您讲讲吧！\n哦——呵呵呵呵呵、咳、咳咳。……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "104ad410f598a07c23a089d927db409232173b3ee3496b9df0ba97171c5d29b7", "ja": "（船に乗ること数時間……。\nようやく、映画のロケ地である島に到着した！）", "zh": "（在船上航行了几个小时……终于抵达了电影取景地所在的岛屿！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "e06065d2cb492295e07885a767a1b1473e2830aa3cdc907ed65e4600d59045a5", "ja": "お疲れさまでした、{$P$}。\n明日から、ここで撮影が始まるんですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n从明天开始，就要在这里拍摄了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "832fdee16a6650b57106468426ea8bf6d949381add93b38fcf669b3ec232ca6a", "ja": "それより聞きましたよ。{$P$}がこの\nオーディション、受けられるよう手配してくれたって。", "zh": "不过我听说了。是{$P$}帮我安排，让我能参加这次试镜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "6588c780f4a8586badd045906705ba68e945d809cad0c8e2d4e44e3d4331b801", "ja": "まあ、それが俺の仕事だからな。それに\n挑戦的な作品だし、みんなの経験にもなると思って。", "zh": "哎，毕竟那是我的工作嘛。而且\n这也是部很有挑战性的作品，我觉得能给大家积累经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "edb63e2dbc90f6a7e3e498e37957e1550675865dc31b0b4b0e4d8aca524aa763", "ja": "ええ。みんな、本読みから熱が入ってましたから。\n今回の撮影、面白い経験が得られそうですね！", "zh": "嗯。大家从读剧本开始就干劲十足了。\n这次的拍摄，感觉能获得一次很有意思的经验呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0131_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0131_story_01_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1695eadd04174c6b4d0c7304d969fbd45341cd6c2596b300fb0484fc4d85dcf", "ja": "話は聞かせてもらったー！", "zh": "事情我都听说啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
